        {
          "id": "ALFeS",
          "type": "ref",
          "ref": "QfPQH",
          "name": "Callout — Client-side filter and missing fields",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "descendants": {
            "z13SH": {
              "content": "This filter (paymentMethod=PERSONAL_REIMBURSABLE, reimbursementStatus=PENDING) is applied client-side, not by the API — fine at today's scale, won't stay that way. reimbursedTo/reimbursedAt exist on the entity but are not exposed on RealisasiResponse — a screen wanting to show who this is owed to beyond the creator would need a DTO change first."
